# Force LF line endings on every checkout.
#
# Windows git converts text files to CRLF when core.autocrlf is true. The
# gofmt check in CI compares files byte for byte, so a CRLF checkout fails
# on files that are already formatted. These rules make the checkout form
# stable on every platform.

* text=auto eol=lf
*.go text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.txt text eol=lf
*.spr text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
